  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 103.04 Administrative and Staff Services. There shall be an administrative assistant and such other staff members as are provided by the office of professional licensure and certification to perform the record-keeping and other statutory functions of the board and to oversee the board's day-to-day operations.\n\nSource. #6379, eff 11-26-96; ss by #8299, eff 3-9-05, EXPIRED: 7-1-16 pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II and 2015, 276:45 and 276:97\n\nNew. #12337, eff 7-22-17",
